  "title": "Feteer Meshaltet",
  "slug": "feteer-meshaltet",
  "summary": "Feteer Meshaltet is a traditional Egyptian flaky pastry made by layering dough with butter and oil. It is characterized by its many thin, crispy layers and soft interior.",
